## Active base for the Dell Ops control plane.
## Fedora's package default uses `task,never`, which disables syscall audit
## contexts and makes operational watches ineffective.

## Clear any package/default rules before loading the reviewed policy.
-D

## Absorb short bursts without silently dropping control-plane changes.
-b 8192
--backlog_wait_time 60000

## Log kernel audit failures without panicking the workstation.
-f 1
